  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">House 80 Rural Liberian Students Annually</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Limited access to secondary schools in rural Liberia compels over 20,000 rural students to pursue secondary education in urban communities each year. But the lack of support to accommodate these students forces them to drop from school and return to their rural communities where they continue to live in poverty. Your donation will go towards the construction of an initial housing unit to provide charitable urban accommodation for rural students as they seek to overcome this challenge.</narrative>
  </description>
